flowchart LR
  E[현재 terminal 환경]
  O{유효한 명시적<br/>terminal override?}
  F[지정 mode<br/>inline · cmux-pane · herdr-pane · tmux-pane]
  C{canonical cmux<br/>identity?}
  H{Herdr 환경·socket·IDs<br/>모두 유효?}
  T{canonical tmux<br/>identity?}
  I[inline child process<br/>taskCwd ?? cwd]
  CM[cmux pane<br/>shared-pane / split policy]
  HA{Herdr layout}
  HT[auto: workspace-scoped layout.apply 1회<br/>tab_id 없음 · focus false<br/>root pane direct wrapper argv]
  HG[strict layout_apply.layout.root<br/>→ pane.get terminal binding]
  HS[split: source 오른쪽 strict child pane<br/>pane.split → legacy pane.send_text]
  TM[tmux pane<br/>auto detached window / split]
  B[interactive bootstrap<br/>trusted filesystem-root cwd]
  G[gate 뒤 wrapper가 validated<br/>effective task/workspace cwd로 이동]
  IR[interactive result path<br/>session JSONL과 durable completion]
  IO[inline result path<br/>stdout JSON events]
  R[동일한 public 결과 계약]

  E --> O
  O -->|yes| F
  O -->|no: cmux 먼저 검사| C
  C -->|yes| CM
  C -->|no: Herdr 다음 검사| H
  H -->|yes| HA
  H -->|no: tmux 다음 검사| T
  T -->|yes| TM
  T -->|no 또는 Windows| I
  HA -->|auto| HT
  HT --> HG
  HA -->|explicit split| HS
  F -->|inline| I
  F -->|cmux-pane| CM
  F -->|herdr-pane| HA
  F -->|tmux-pane| TM
  CM --> B
  HG --> B
  HS --> B
  TM --> B
  B --> G
  G --> IR
  I --> IO
  IR --> R
  IO --> R

  classDef contract stroke-width:3px
  class R contract
